      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 15.100  Fuegito</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Robert W. Strickland 7 June 2013</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Crown Based on "Fuego Verde" by Gustavo Castelblanco. Based on photo</text>
